(
    title: "32 in 1 Game Cartridge",
    description: Some("A compilation of 32 early Atari 2600 games on one cartridge, among them Combat, Boxing, Surround, Outlaw, Bowling, Air-Sea Battle and 3-D Tic-Tac-Toe. There is no on-screen menu: the cartridge advances through the games in a fixed sequence, moving to the next one each time the console is switched off and on again, so you reach a particular game by power-cycling the required number of times."),
